  "definition_ja": "円や球の中心と、周上（表面上）の点を結ぶ線分。また、その長さ。直径は半径の 2 倍。",
  "definition_en": "A segment from the center of a circle or sphere to a point on it, or the length of that segment. The diameter is twice the radius.",
  "latex": "d = 2r",
  "spoken_en": "d equals two r",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "The radius is half the diameter, so if the diameter is 10, the radius is 5.",
      "ja": "半径は直径の半分だから、直径が 10 なら半径は 5。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "The circumference of a circle is 12π cm. Find the radius.",
      "ja": "円周の長さが 12π cm である円の半径を求めよ。",
      "register": "written"
